		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Three conjoined reptilian upper torsos with a writhing viperian lower torso. Duke of heresies and blasphemies.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 100, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 +3 flail +10 (1d6+3 + casterbane), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +6, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 21</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Casterbane</strong>. Spellcasters struck by Geryon, WIS 18+ or unable to cast spells for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Fire and cold immune. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Perceive Destiny</strong>. 1/round, Geryon can reroll one roll.</p><p></p><p><strong>Threefold Body</strong>. Geryon has ADV against effects like blindness or deafness.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
